%% Yole - File Synchronization Flow
%% Shows offline-first sync with conflict detection

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Editor as Text Editor
    participant Doc as Document Model
    participant SVC as NetworkStorageService
    participant Cache as Cache (CacheEntry)
    participant Queue as Sync Queue<br/>(NetworkOperation)
    participant API as Remote Storage API

    Note over User,API: Local Change Detection

    User->>Editor: Edit document content
    Editor->>Doc: Update content
    Doc->>Doc: document.touch()<br/>touchTime = currentTimeMillis()

    Editor->>SVC: getSyncStatus("/doc.md")
    SVC-->>Editor: Flow<Map<String, SyncStatus>>

    Doc->>Doc: hasChanged() = true<br/>(getFileModTime() > modTime)

    Note over User,API: Queue Upload Operation

    Editor->>SVC: syncFile("/doc.md")
    SVC->>Queue: NetworkOperation.createUpload(<br/>  localPath, remotePath, fileSize)
    Queue->>Queue: Set status = PENDING<br/>Set priority = 100

    Note over Queue: Backpressure: Operations queued<br/>when offline or rate-limited

    SVC->>SVC: Check isOnline

    alt Online -- proceed immediately
        Queue->>Queue: status = IN_PROGRESS
        SVC->>API: Upload file content
        API-->>SVC: Upload response with metadata

        SVC->>Queue: operation.withStatus(COMPLETED)
        SVC->>Cache: Update CacheEntry<br/>(lastModified, checksum, size)
        Cache->>Cache: withContent(size, checksum, now)
        SVC->>SVC: syncStatusMap[path] = SYNCED
        SVC-->>Editor: Flow<NetworkOperation>(COMPLETED)

    else Offline -- queue for later
        Queue->>Queue: Remain PENDING
        SVC->>SVC: syncStatusMap[path] = PENDING_UPLOAD
        SVC-->>Editor: Flow<NetworkOperation>(PENDING)
        Note over Queue: Will retry when connectivity restored
    end

    Note over User,API: Download / Remote Change Detection

    Editor->>SVC: listFiles("/")
    SVC->>API: GET file listing
    API-->>SVC: List with lastModified timestamps

    SVC->>Cache: Compare remote lastModified<br/>vs cached lastModified
    Cache-->>SVC: Local version older

    SVC->>SVC: syncStatusMap[path] = PENDING_DOWNLOAD
    SVC->>Queue: NetworkOperation.createDownload(<br/>  remotePath, localPath, size)

    Queue->>Queue: status = IN_PROGRESS
    SVC->>API: Download file content
    API-->>SVC: File bytes + metadata

    SVC->>Cache: Create/update CacheEntry
    Cache->>Cache: CacheEntry.create(<br/>  remoteDocumentId, localPath,<br/>  remotePath, size, contentType)

    SVC->>Queue: operation.withProgress(1.0)
    SVC->>Queue: operation.withStatus(COMPLETED)
    SVC->>SVC: syncStatusMap[path] = SYNCED
    SVC-->>Editor: Updated content available

    Note over User,API: Conflict Detection

    Editor->>SVC: syncFile("/shared-doc.md")

    SVC->>API: Get remote file metadata
    API-->>SVC: Remote lastModified: T2

    SVC->>Cache: Get cached lastModified
    Cache-->>SVC: Local lastModified: T1

    SVC->>SVC: Check local pending changes

    alt No conflict (local only OR remote only changed)
        SVC->>SVC: Proceed with upload or download
    else Conflict (both changed since last sync)
        SVC->>SVC: syncStatusMap[path] = CONFLICT
        SVC-->>Editor: SyncStatus.CONFLICT
        Editor->>User: Show conflict resolution UI
        User->>Editor: Choose: Keep Local / Keep Remote / Merge
        Editor->>SVC: Resolve conflict with chosen strategy
    end

    Note over User,API: Cache Management

    Editor->>SVC: addToCache("/important.md", priority=200)
    SVC->>Cache: CacheEntry.create(docId,<br/>  localPath, remotePath, size)
    Cache->>Cache: withPinStatus(isPinned=true)
    SVC->>API: Download for offline access
    API-->>SVC: File content
    SVC->>Cache: withContent(size, checksum, now)
    SVC-->>Editor: Cached for offline

    Editor->>SVC: clearCache()
    SVC->>Cache: Remove non-pinned entries<br/>(canBeEvicted = !isPinned && !isInUse)
    SVC-->>Editor: Cache cleared

    Note over User,API: Sync All

    Editor->>SVC: syncAll(forceSync=false)
    SVC->>SVC: Enumerate all tracked paths
    loop For each tracked file
        SVC->>SVC: Check syncStatus
        alt Status != SYNCED or forceSync
            SVC->>Queue: Create sync operation
        end
    end
    SVC-->>Editor: Flow<NetworkOperation> for each file
